WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.100 --> 01:38.900
=Episode 8=

5
01:39.180 --> 01:44.500
(The Day of the Peony Festival; Upright and Honorable)

6
02:31.700 --> 02:34.700
(Cuiyun Tower)

7
02:42.780 --> 02:44.940
(Cuiyun Tower)

8
03:02.620 --> 03:04.500
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

9
03:06.740 --> 03:09.020
(Mingde Gate)

10
03:09.020 --> 03:10.420
The year the seven Military Governors rebelled,

11
03:11.060 --> 03:12.100
my whole family was killed.

12
03:12.940 --> 03:14.260
I was forced into a life of degradation.

13
03:16.740 --> 03:17.740
Ten years have passed.

14
03:18.740 --> 03:20.700
No one's ever lifted a finger to help me,

15
03:21.860 --> 03:23.260
let alone buy my freedom.

16
03:23.700 --> 03:25.020
We've both fallen on hard times.

17
03:25.860 --> 03:26.220
Miss,

18
03:27.540 --> 03:28.020
you must leave now.

19
03:30.140 --> 03:31.300
But if I leave today,

20
03:32.260 --> 03:33.260
what will happen to you?

21
03:33.780 --> 03:35.140
If Zhang Renjing finds out

22
03:35.380 --> 03:36.900
you bought my freedom,

23
03:37.180 --> 03:37.420
then...

24
03:37.420 --> 03:37.900
Don't worry.

25
03:39.420 --> 03:40.540
I'll find a way out.

26
03:41.580 --> 03:43.020
Just leave Sheng'an,

27
03:43.380 --> 03:45.580
so he can never bother you again.

28
03:46.500 --> 03:47.860
You've saved me twice.

29
03:49.300 --> 03:50.100
I'm deeply in your debt.

30
03:51.420 --> 03:53.940
I'll repay you in my next life.

31
03:54.300 --> 03:55.260
All I wish is

32
03:55.940 --> 03:56.700
that you can live freely

33
03:57.420 --> 03:58.340
from now on.

34
04:11.680 --> 04:14.200
(Mingde Gate)

35
04:24.420 --> 04:24.940
(Mr. Zhang!)

36
04:25.060 --> 04:25.780
(It's been a while.)

37
04:25.780 --> 04:26.340
(Nice to see you both!)

38
04:26.340 --> 04:31.180
(Sigui Garden)

39
04:36.780 --> 04:37.180
Captain,

40
04:37.820 --> 04:38.380
sorry for the wait.

41
04:40.220 --> 04:41.460
What took you so long?

42
04:41.620 --> 04:42.740
I've waited ages.

43
04:43.500 --> 04:44.300
I came on foot,

44
04:44.620 --> 04:45.140
so I'm a little late.

45
04:46.020 --> 04:47.700
The private room is ready.

46
04:51.420 --> 04:51.980
It's ready?

47
04:53.300 --> 04:54.260
Please follow me.

48
04:58.780 --> 04:59.260
This way.

49
05:11.260 --> 05:11.660
Where is she?

50
05:13.300 --> 05:13.980
Please wait, Captain.

51
05:14.420 --> 05:15.740
Just a little longer.

52
05:16.140 --> 05:17.020
I'll let you know

53
05:17.300 --> 05:18.700
as soon as Xu Mianmian's here.

54
05:19.620 --> 05:20.580
What a hassle.

55
05:21.700 --> 05:22.340
Tell her to hurry up!

56
05:22.500 --> 05:22.780
Got it.

57
05:23.220 --> 05:23.900
I'll go check.

58
05:31.940 --> 05:32.420
Captain,

59
05:33.020 --> 05:33.620
what's this?

60
05:34.340 --> 05:34.740
Well...

61
05:36.820 --> 05:39.340
I paid a lot for this from foreign traders.

62
05:39.620 --> 05:40.780
It's powerful.

63
05:44.620 --> 05:45.300
You wouldn't understand.

64
05:45.660 --> 05:46.140
Go on!

65
05:46.660 --> 05:46.980
Yes, sir.

66
05:55.660 --> 05:56.140
Excuse me.

67
05:56.140 --> 05:57.420
(What a grand procession!)

68
05:57.420 --> 05:58.540
(Magnificent!)

69
05:58.540 --> 06:00.380
(I've never seen such a splendid carriage!)

70
06:20.580 --> 06:22.980
When will the Peony Goddess rite be over?

71
06:23.740 --> 06:24.740
(Jin Bu, Imperial Sacrifice Official) Your Highness,

72
06:25.500 --> 06:26.420
it ends at noon.

73
06:30.140 --> 06:30.580
Good.

74
06:36.980 --> 06:38.260
(Why not compose a poem?)

75
06:38.540 --> 06:38.900
(Exactly!)

76
06:38.900 --> 06:39.820
(It'd add to the fun.)

77
06:40.500 --> 06:41.700
(Let's just admire the flowers.)

78
06:51.220 --> 06:52.340
(Such fine blooms)

79
06:52.780 --> 06:54.260
(are rare to see outside.)

80
06:55.860 --> 06:57.820
(They must've been carefully tended.)

81
07:04.660 --> 07:05.100
Your Highness,

82
07:05.900 --> 07:06.900
go ahead and pray to the Peony Goddess.

83
07:07.180 --> 07:07.940
I'll excuse myself for a moment.

84
07:09.220 --> 07:09.740
But we haven't...

85
07:11.420 --> 07:12.060
Go enjoy yourself, too.

86
07:17.420 --> 07:18.340
(Let's look over here.)

87
07:18.420 --> 07:18.740
(All right.)

88
07:22.020 --> 07:22.540
Yan Shang.

89
07:30.500 --> 07:30.900
Your Highness.

90
07:32.340 --> 07:33.380
What brings you here?

91
07:34.740 --> 07:35.260
What's wrong?

92
07:36.020 --> 07:37.180
Am I not allowed at this festival?

93
07:39.100 --> 07:39.780
I just...

94
07:40.740 --> 07:41.420
never expected

95
07:41.940 --> 07:43.460
to see you again so soon.

96
07:45.980 --> 07:46.900
Since I've run into you,

97
07:47.500 --> 07:49.220
show me around the garden.

98
07:51.100 --> 07:52.820
Your Highness, I have things to do.

99
07:53.300 --> 07:54.620
What could be more important than me?

100
07:56.340 --> 07:56.660
Come.

101
08:04.340 --> 08:06.340
(Candied fruit, plums, and apricots!)

102
08:06.620 --> 08:07.180
This one looks nice.

103
08:08.260 --> 08:08.740
We'll take it.

104
08:09.980 --> 08:10.340
This one.

105
08:10.940 --> 08:11.220
And this one.

106
08:11.220 --> 08:12.540
(Sweet and sour. Delicious!)

107
08:17.700 --> 08:18.060
This one, too!

108
08:19.860 --> 08:20.540
Pay up.

109
08:22.260 --> 08:22.540
Here.

110
08:27.820 --> 08:28.300
Miss,

111
08:28.820 --> 08:30.020
get some Peony Goddess knots.

112
08:30.300 --> 08:31.100
Tie them around your wrists

113
08:31.100 --> 08:32.660
for good luck and good health.

114
08:32.860 --> 08:33.540
The Peony Goddess will bless you.

115
08:34.620 --> 08:35.180
I'll take them all.

116
08:36.740 --> 08:37.380
Peony Goddess knots!

117
08:38.940 --> 08:39.220
Help me tie it.

118
08:39.220 --> 08:40.780
(Pretty sachets and purses!)

119
08:40.940 --> 08:42.140
(All handmade.)

120
08:42.860 --> 08:44.260
(Ladies, come take a look.)

121
08:45.340 --> 08:45.660
Thank you.

122
08:45.660 --> 08:46.820
(Sachets and purses!)

123
08:47.740 --> 08:49.580
(Pretty sachets and purses!)

124
08:53.820 --> 08:54.100
There.

125
08:54.260 --> 08:54.700
Does it look good?

126
08:55.900 --> 08:56.540
Of course.

127
08:58.340 --> 08:59.580
You're not even paying attention.

128
09:02.900 --> 09:03.500
(Twenty copper coins.)

129
09:29.620 --> 09:30.780
What are you doing?

130
09:34.500 --> 09:36.220
Tired of showing me around?

131
09:36.860 --> 09:37.340
I wouldn't dare.

132
09:38.900 --> 09:39.540
Keep up.

133
09:44.700 --> 09:45.180
Yan Shang,

134
09:46.820 --> 09:47.900
this garden is huge.

135
09:48.260 --> 09:49.180
What's your favorite spot?

136
09:50.540 --> 09:52.820
There's an old stone well in the northwest corner.

137
09:53.260 --> 09:54.020
The clear water

138
09:54.540 --> 09:56.020
reflects the clouds and trees.

139
09:56.740 --> 09:57.580
It's peaceful and lovely.

140
09:58.740 --> 09:59.380
Not my kind of place.

141
10:00.740 --> 10:02.700
(Trinkets and knickknacks!)

142
10:02.940 --> 10:03.620
Let's look over there.

143
10:05.100 --> 10:07.220
(Lovely things! Come take a look!)

144
10:07.420 --> 10:08.300
(Miss, have a look!)

145
10:08.820 --> 10:09.380
Tired from walking?

146
10:13.780 --> 10:15.340
Shall we take a break?

147
10:18.420 --> 10:18.860
Yan Shang,

148
10:20.500 --> 10:22.100
your story last night was bad enough.

149
10:23.420 --> 10:23.940
Today,

150
10:24.700 --> 10:25.940
don't upset me again.

151
10:42.620 --> 10:42.980
Chunhua.

152
10:47.500 --> 10:47.900
This is for you.

153
10:57.220 --> 10:57.820
Lip rouge?

154
10:59.580 --> 11:00.620
Just something I picked up.

155
11:00.940 --> 11:01.740
I don't know much about these things.

156
11:02.300 --> 11:03.180
If you don't like it,

157
11:03.340 --> 11:03.900
throw it away.

158
11:09.780 --> 11:10.220
And this.

159
11:12.020 --> 11:12.420
And this.

160
11:13.900 --> 11:14.380
And this.

161
11:15.820 --> 11:16.580
These earrings, too.

162
11:25.620 --> 11:26.460
Hope you like them.

163
11:27.340 --> 11:27.980
All right.

164
11:28.380 --> 11:29.060
Stop pulling things out.

165
11:29.300 --> 11:29.940
I can't carry all this.

166
11:34.580 --> 11:35.100
Liu Wenji,

167
11:35.660 --> 11:36.340
I need to ask you something.

168
11:37.260 --> 11:37.940
Go ahead.

169
11:38.420 --> 11:39.140
Do you like me?

170
11:57.900 --> 11:58.380
Liu Wenji,

171
11:58.900 --> 11:59.700
I do like you.

172
12:00.260 --> 12:01.460
If you like me too,

173
12:01.740 --> 12:02.820
will you marry me?

174
12:12.060 --> 12:12.620
Chunhua...

175
12:15.940 --> 12:16.500
My father

176
12:17.180 --> 12:18.460
always told me

177
12:20.100 --> 12:21.340
that I should earn honors,

178
12:22.660 --> 12:23.380
pass the imperial exam,

179
12:24.420 --> 12:24.940
and...

180
12:28.420 --> 12:28.980
and...

181
12:32.900 --> 12:34.100
marry...

182
12:35.900 --> 12:37.820
a woman of noble birth.

183
12:53.340 --> 12:53.860
But, Chunhua,

184
12:54.260 --> 12:55.060
that's not what I want.

185
12:56.620 --> 12:57.380
I like you.

186
13:05.500 --> 13:06.500
I'll make you my wife.

187
13:16.820 --> 13:17.620
It's a promise, then.

188
13:34.780 --> 13:35.220
Thank you.

189
13:36.020 --> 13:37.620
(Look, isn't this the lot we wanted?)

190
13:39.180 --> 13:39.540
Go ahead.

191
13:39.540 --> 13:40.020
(Exactly!)

192
13:43.660 --> 13:45.180
They say the peony lots here never miss.

193
13:45.660 --> 13:46.020
Try one.

194
13:46.860 --> 13:47.580
Your Highness, please.

195
13:48.420 --> 13:49.260
You draw first.

196
13:50.340 --> 13:51.700
I don't believe in fortune-telling.

197
13:52.700 --> 13:53.260
(You two in front!)

198
13:53.780 --> 13:54.300
(Are you drawing or not?)

199
13:55.700 --> 13:56.220
Hurry up!

200
13:59.980 --> 14:02.220
(A phoenix heralds a new age; the moon lights her lonely path)

201
14:13.740 --> 14:15.780
(Great statecraft draws vast wisdom; the heavens await mending at court.)

202
14:16.180 --> 14:17.140
The court...

203
14:19.020 --> 14:21.020
Seems you'll hold the highest office one day.

204
14:22.820 --> 14:23.580
In that case,

205
14:24.020 --> 14:24.940
this lot must be wrong.

206
14:25.500 --> 14:26.180
Governing is hard enough,

207
14:26.540 --> 14:28.300
(A phoenix heralds a new age.) let alone "mending the heavens."

208
14:29.460 --> 14:30.340
What did you draw?

209
14:31.300 --> 14:31.820
Not telling you.

210
14:32.660 --> 14:33.340
Didn't you say it doesn't count?

211
14:52.500 --> 14:55.980
(Retreat of Grace)

212
15:11.820 --> 15:12.260
(Wonderful!)

213
15:12.620 --> 15:13.140
(Wonderful!)

214
15:17.180 --> 15:19.900
(Retreat of Grace)

215
15:26.460 --> 15:29.300
(Retreat of Grace)

216
15:40.900 --> 15:42.940
(The Peony Goddess rite is almost over.)

217
16:12.340 --> 16:13.220
Princess Danyang is over there.

218
16:19.580 --> 16:19.900
Her stuff.

219
16:36.100 --> 16:37.060
(So beautiful!)

220
16:37.900 --> 16:38.660
(Indeed!)

221
16:41.020 --> 16:42.380
(I've never seen peonies like these!)

222
16:44.020 --> 16:44.620
Yan Shang, look!

223
16:44.900 --> 16:45.260
Wanyao!

224
16:46.980 --> 16:47.900
You scared me half to death!

225
16:48.380 --> 16:48.980
Where's Yan Shang?

226
16:50.700 --> 16:51.060
Wanyao,

227
16:51.820 --> 16:52.500
when did you get here?

228
16:52.740 --> 16:53.300
Where do you want to go next?

229
16:53.460 --> 16:53.820
I'll come with you.

230
16:53.900 --> 16:54.660
I've told you,

231
16:54.980 --> 16:55.780
don't call me Wanyao.

232
16:56.980 --> 16:57.460
Coming through!

233
17:17.020 --> 17:17.540
What is it?

234
17:18.180 --> 17:20.500
Her Highness wants you to fetch some wine

235
17:20.860 --> 17:21.740
and wait for her in the room.

236
17:21.900 --> 17:23.380
How did you know?

237
17:26.220 --> 17:27.340
You can ask me anything.

238
17:27.780 --> 17:28.380
However,

239
17:28.860 --> 17:30.420
when you're serving Her Highness,

240
17:30.900 --> 17:32.220
ask fewer questions.

241
17:35.660 --> 17:36.700
Thank you for the advice.

242
17:37.020 --> 17:38.020
I'll fetch the wine now.

243
17:47.700 --> 17:49.180
(Jifu)

244
17:55.340 --> 17:57.140
(Jifu)

245
17:59.780 --> 18:00.380
(Jifang) I've heard

246
18:00.700 --> 18:02.980
Grand Princess Luling has a private pavilion in the garden.

247
18:03.220 --> 18:04.660
Which one is it?

248
18:05.180 --> 18:06.980
Whenever the Grand Princess comes to see the flowers,

249
18:06.980 --> 18:08.700
she takes over Jifang Pavilion.

250
18:08.900 --> 18:10.140
(Jifang)

251
18:15.380 --> 18:20.740
(Jifu)

252
18:37.180 --> 18:38.140
Captain, sorry to keep you waiting.

253
18:38.660 --> 18:38.980
Let's go.

254
18:39.820 --> 18:40.580
I'll take you there.

255
18:40.580 --> 18:41.260
Move it.

256
18:45.260 --> 18:45.900
This way.

257
18:47.300 --> 18:48.580
The Jifu Pavilion.

258
18:49.460 --> 18:50.380
Wait here, Captain.

259
18:51.060 --> 18:52.180
Miss Xu will be here soon.

260
18:55.260 --> 18:56.340
(Jifang)

261
18:58.780 --> 19:00.580
(Jifu)

262
19:02.580 --> 19:03.020
Fu...

263
19:03.220 --> 19:05.140
(Jifu)

264
19:05.940 --> 19:06.740
I know this character.

265
19:07.460 --> 19:08.820
Fu means good fortune!

266
19:17.100 --> 19:18.020
(Jifu)

267
19:21.220 --> 19:23.300
(Jifang)

268
19:45.580 --> 19:46.500
That idiot!

269
19:47.260 --> 19:48.300
He's actually fallen asleep!

270
19:49.460 --> 19:51.420
And he still expects a promotion?

271
19:52.340 --> 19:53.740
Wake him up!

272
19:53.740 --> 19:54.180
- Yes! - Yes!

273
20:03.620 --> 20:05.060
Who's this old man?

274
20:14.780 --> 20:15.420
Wake up!

275
20:41.700 --> 20:43.020
How dare you!

276
20:43.420 --> 20:44.980
Look at yourself!

277
20:45.340 --> 20:46.740
How dare you offend me?

278
20:47.140 --> 20:47.980
Kill him!

279
20:55.900 --> 20:56.420
Seize him!

280
20:57.380 --> 20:58.780
Seal off the entire garden!

281
20:59.300 --> 21:00.380
Until that filthy wretch is caught,

282
21:00.740 --> 21:01.780
no one is leaving!

283
21:10.420 --> 21:10.820
(Over there!)

284
21:11.620 --> 21:12.100
(He's over there!)

285
21:20.980 --> 21:21.500
(What's happening?)

286
21:21.500 --> 21:21.820
(Take him away!)

287
21:23.620 --> 21:23.940
(Move!)

288
21:28.140 --> 21:28.500
Captain!

289
21:29.020 --> 21:29.580
Run!

290
21:33.140 --> 21:33.420
Hurry!

291
21:34.980 --> 21:35.860
Captain, we're in deep trouble!

292
21:36.260 --> 21:37.020
I'll get you out of here.

293
21:37.380 --> 21:37.700
Hurry!

294
21:51.900 --> 21:52.420
What's going on?

295
22:13.220 --> 22:13.860
Get me out.

296
22:31.020 --> 22:31.780
Quiet.

297
22:32.700 --> 22:34.420
At that ruined temple in Chuzhou,

298
22:34.860 --> 22:35.780
it was you

299
22:36.140 --> 22:38.700
who slashed my father's knees!

300
22:41.900 --> 22:42.540
Your men

301
22:43.300 --> 22:44.420
killed my little brother.

302
22:45.860 --> 22:47.580
You slit my mother's throat.

303
22:48.060 --> 22:48.940
And my eldest brother

304
22:50.060 --> 22:52.100
was crippled for life.

305
22:53.260 --> 22:55.380
They suffered a thousand times more

306
22:56.820 --> 22:57.700
than you!

307
24:04.300 --> 24:05.060
Zhang Renjing,

308
24:06.740 --> 24:07.780
did you ever think

309
24:09.300 --> 24:10.300
this day would come?

310
25:08.140 --> 25:13.100
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart♪

311
25:13.100 --> 25:17.380
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

312
25:17.660 --> 25:22.240
♪Books bear no blade♪

313
25:22.240 --> 25:26.580
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls can pierce the sky♪

314
25:27.820 --> 25:31.980
♪My body is the furnace, flames reach the clouds♪

315
25:32.290 --> 25:37.180
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

316
25:37.580 --> 25:41.420
♪I see no court, only a boundless world♪

317
25:41.780 --> 25:46.220
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪

318
25:46.860 --> 25:51.420
♪I gaze at high peaks and sails far away♪

319
25:51.940 --> 25:55.860
♪With the world in my heart, I leave the shore♪

320
25:56.100 --> 26:00.620
♪With rain ahead, I cross the pass♪

321
26:01.540 --> 26:05.300
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

322
26:06.180 --> 26:10.780
♪By noon, the mist will lift; rivers will bend♪

323
26:11.180 --> 26:14.660
♪I'll take the open road and journey home♪

324
26:15.580 --> 26:20.300
♪With rosy clouds, I bid the moon goodnight♪

325
26:20.980 --> 26:24.540
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

326
26:38.220 --> 26:38.980
(By order of the Grand Princess,)

327
26:39.260 --> 26:40.380
(no one may leave the garden.)

328
26:40.580 --> 26:41.220
(Violators will be arrested!)

329
26:42.740 --> 26:44.100
There's been a murder in the garden.

330
26:44.940 --> 26:45.940
As a judicial officer,

331
26:46.300 --> 26:46.820
I must investigate.

332
26:48.100 --> 26:48.740
Go on.

333
26:54.020 --> 26:55.780
(The snake's head and the hornet)

334
26:56.580 --> 26:57.740
(were crushed beneath the wheel.)

335
26:58.380 --> 26:59.580
(They were both dead.)

336
27:00.820 --> 27:01.260
(Your Highness,)

337
27:03.100 --> 27:03.700
(I'm leaving.)

338
27:11.300 --> 27:11.900
(Yan Shang,)

339
27:12.820 --> 27:13.500
(where are you?)

340
27:17.860 --> 27:18.620
(The clear water)

341
27:19.140 --> 27:20.620
(reflecting the clouds and trees.)

342
27:21.340 --> 27:22.220
(It's peaceful and lovely.)

343
27:41.420 --> 27:41.860
Yan Shang!

344
27:43.460 --> 27:43.940
Your Highness.

345
27:44.300 --> 27:44.780
Come with me!

346
28:03.660 --> 28:03.980
Hurry!

347
28:04.260 --> 28:04.620
Your Highness...

348
28:05.380 --> 28:05.700
Go!

349
28:15.020 --> 28:15.500
Your Highness...

350
28:17.060 --> 28:17.820
I've killed someone.

351
28:18.260 --> 28:18.620
Quiet!

352
28:19.900 --> 28:20.620
I can't get away.

353
28:21.420 --> 28:22.140
Fang Tong, go!

354
28:31.300 --> 28:32.260
I won't drag you down with me.

355
28:32.620 --> 28:33.300
Stop talking nonsense!

356
28:52.540 --> 28:53.500
(Who's there? Get down!)

357
29:03.740 --> 29:04.660
What bad luck!

358
29:05.220 --> 29:06.460
I'll have to burn incense all day!

359
29:11.700 --> 29:12.300
Aunt!

360
29:15.100 --> 29:15.740
Wanyao?

361
29:16.300 --> 29:16.860
You're here too.

362
29:17.540 --> 29:19.220
I heard someone was killed in the garden!

363
29:19.660 --> 29:20.740
How terrifying!

364
29:22.100 --> 29:22.620
Aunt,

365
29:23.220 --> 29:24.860
can I go home early?

366
29:25.540 --> 29:26.820
There's blood everywhere.

367
29:27.180 --> 29:27.780
I really...

368
29:28.260 --> 29:30.180
Aunt, I really can't stand the sight of blood!

369
29:31.020 --> 29:32.140
Let her go!

370
29:32.580 --> 29:33.300
Thank you, Aunt!

371
29:33.500 --> 29:34.220
You're the best!

372
29:49.780 --> 29:50.740
(Why is that carriage moving?)

373
29:51.940 --> 29:53.220
(Mr. Shen, easy.)

374
29:53.860 --> 29:56.420
(Malted milk cakes)

375
30:06.100 --> 30:06.780
Why did you kill him?

376
30:13.060 --> 30:13.860
For revenge.

377
30:14.380 --> 30:14.980
What revenge?

378
30:17.900 --> 30:19.220
Back when we were in Lingnan,

379
30:21.740 --> 30:22.860
I told Your Highness

380
30:23.780 --> 30:25.460
my family fled south

381
30:27.300 --> 30:28.500
to escape the Rebellion.

382
30:30.380 --> 30:31.740
Mother dead, younger brother killed.

383
30:34.740 --> 30:36.020
Father left crippled, elder brother traumatized.

384
30:39.220 --> 30:40.380
As we fled south,

385
30:41.620 --> 30:43.300
we watched prosperous cities fall.

386
30:44.420 --> 30:45.420
Splendor turned to ashes.

387
30:47.580 --> 30:49.860
Corpses littered the fields and wastelands.

388
30:51.340 --> 30:52.020
Some were soldiers,

389
30:53.740 --> 30:54.460
others ordinary folk.

390
30:56.620 --> 30:58.180
Wherever the rebel warlords went,

391
30:59.100 --> 30:59.940
they slaughtered the people first.

392
31:01.580 --> 31:02.460
Everyone fled in fear

393
31:03.660 --> 31:04.860
at their approach.

394
31:07.820 --> 31:08.940
We were lucky.

395
31:10.700 --> 31:11.820
We'd managed to escape them all.

396
31:18.700 --> 31:19.300
And then?

397
31:22.020 --> 31:22.580
Later,

398
31:26.820 --> 31:27.860
at that ruined temple,

399
31:29.300 --> 31:30.860
we ran into a squad of the Shence Army.

400
31:35.580 --> 31:36.220
We couldn't escape.

401
31:40.780 --> 31:41.700
They killed innocents to claim military merit.

402
31:48.780 --> 31:49.700
The man who just died

403
31:50.780 --> 31:51.940
was Zhang Renjing.

404
31:54.940 --> 31:55.500
Back then,

405
31:58.260 --> 31:59.780
he was just a squad leader,

406
32:00.940 --> 32:02.180
roaming the area with his men,

407
32:02.420 --> 32:03.860
desperate to rack up kills.

408
32:04.580 --> 32:04.980
So...

409
32:07.460 --> 32:10.020
he cut the ears off innocent people,

410
32:10.100 --> 32:10.860
stuffed them into a sack,

411
32:12.380 --> 32:13.220
and claimed military merit.

412
32:14.100 --> 32:14.420
And then...

413
32:16.060 --> 32:16.900
he got his wish.

414
32:20.900 --> 32:21.940
So I killed him.

415
32:24.660 --> 32:25.820
He deserved to die long ago.

416
32:36.620 --> 32:37.380
I killed him.

417
32:39.180 --> 32:40.740
I killed him personally!

418
32:42.180 --> 32:42.820
I avenged them.

419
32:43.660 --> 32:44.700
I avenged my family.

420
32:52.940 --> 32:53.300
Yan Shang.

421
32:56.780 --> 32:57.340
Look at me.

422
32:58.740 --> 32:59.580
You've suffered so much.

423
33:01.300 --> 33:02.340
At last, you've cast off

424
33:02.940 --> 33:03.820
that heavy burden.

425
33:04.700 --> 33:06.180
I envy you for that.

426
33:08.180 --> 33:09.300
You've done right as a son

427
33:10.460 --> 33:11.100
and as a brother.

428
33:13.260 --> 33:14.140
If your mother

429
33:14.900 --> 33:16.140
and brother know from the afterlife,

430
33:17.700 --> 33:18.500
they can rest in peace.

431
33:25.980 --> 33:27.580
You've carried this burden for too long.

432
33:29.780 --> 33:31.140
It breaks my heart to see you like this.

433
33:34.340 --> 33:34.860
Don't be afraid.

434
33:38.500 --> 33:39.540
We're out of the garden now.

435
34:16.020 --> 34:16.660
(How much longer do we have to wait?)

436
34:16.660 --> 34:17.300
(Everyone, stand back!)

437
34:17.620 --> 34:17.940
(Exactly!)

438
34:18.060 --> 34:19.300
(One more step and I'll arrest you!)

439
34:19.420 --> 34:20.220
(Back off!)

440
34:20.300 --> 34:20.620
(You!)

441
34:20.660 --> 34:21.020
(Hurry!)

442
34:21.460 --> 34:22.100
(Back!)

443
34:22.180 --> 34:23.100
(We're only following orders!)

444
34:23.220 --> 34:23.900
(We have work to do!)

445
34:23.900 --> 34:24.860
(Quiet, or you'll all be arrested!)

446
34:25.620 --> 34:26.060
Your Highness,

447
34:26.340 --> 34:27.500
have you seen Princess Danyang?

448
34:27.820 --> 34:28.820
I've looked everywhere for her.

449
34:29.260 --> 34:29.620
Quiet!

450
34:29.620 --> 34:30.260
How dare you!

451
34:30.980 --> 34:32.820
How would I know where she is?

452
34:33.980 --> 34:35.220
How dare a maid of Princess Danyang

453
34:35.500 --> 34:36.660
defy her betters!

454
34:36.860 --> 34:37.540
(Don't crowd here!)

455
34:37.620 --> 34:38.380
(Everyone, stand back!)

456
34:39.220 --> 34:40.260
(Any more trouble, and I'll arrest you!)

457
34:40.260 --> 34:41.220
(Back! Move back!)

458
34:41.380 --> 34:41.900
(Back!)

459
34:41.900 --> 34:42.380
Wenji.

460
34:42.740 --> 34:43.340
Don't worry.

461
34:43.540 --> 34:44.260
I'll keep looking with you.

462
34:44.260 --> 34:44.660
(Back!)

463
34:44.980 --> 34:45.260
Let's go.

464
34:45.340 --> 34:45.700
(Back!)

465
34:47.100 --> 34:48.380
Just my luck!

466
34:48.580 --> 34:48.900
(Back!)

467
34:49.300 --> 34:50.180
Go ask them

468
34:50.300 --> 34:51.300
when they'll let us leave.

469
34:51.540 --> 34:51.860
(Back!)

470
34:52.020 --> 34:53.420
I just asked.

471
34:53.820 --> 34:56.060
Princess Luling is still furious.

472
34:56.540 --> 34:57.500
She's only a woman,

473
34:57.980 --> 34:58.900
and all she's got is...

474
35:02.620 --> 35:03.180
(Let us go!)

475
35:03.180 --> 35:03.900
(What did we do wrong?)

476
35:05.780 --> 35:06.900
(I swear, I know nothing!)

477
35:07.140 --> 35:07.700
(Why are you keeping us here?)

478
35:07.700 --> 35:08.620
(When will you let us go?)

479
35:08.620 --> 35:09.060
(Step back!)

480
35:09.300 --> 35:09.860
(Step back!)

481
35:10.100 --> 35:10.660
(Let us go!)

482
35:10.660 --> 35:11.060
(Back!)

483
35:12.980 --> 35:13.860
(No further!)

484
35:13.980 --> 35:14.420
(Everyone, stand back!)

485
35:14.420 --> 35:15.340
(Are you pushing us around?)

486
35:15.460 --> 35:16.340
(Everyone, back!)

487
35:19.020 --> 35:20.420
Your Highness, we couldn't find the killer.

488
35:20.900 --> 35:21.340
Useless!

489
35:21.780 --> 35:22.740
Search again!

490
35:22.740 --> 35:23.060
Yes!

491
35:26.460 --> 35:26.740
Your Highness,

492
35:27.300 --> 35:28.460
we've searched every corner of the garden.

493
35:28.820 --> 35:30.300
Another search would be pointless.

494
35:31.140 --> 35:32.660
Though we didn't catch the killer,

495
35:33.140 --> 35:34.380
we did detain several suspects.

496
35:35.020 --> 35:35.420
I'll send them

497
35:35.420 --> 35:36.700
to the Court of Judicial Review for questioning

498
35:36.980 --> 35:38.220
and give Your Highness an answer.

499
35:38.740 --> 35:40.020
Then what are we waiting for?

500
35:40.620 --> 35:41.340
Back to my residence!

501
35:49.500 --> 35:50.580
Bring that Imperial Sacrifice official

502
35:50.580 --> 35:51.380
to the Court of Judicial Review.

503
35:51.900 --> 35:52.340
I'll question him myself.

504
35:53.580 --> 35:53.860
Yes, sir!

505
35:57.340 --> 35:57.700
Stand down!

506
36:01.660 --> 36:02.020
(They're letting us go!)

507
36:02.540 --> 36:03.020
(Let's get out of here.)

508
36:10.420 --> 36:11.020
(Where's Wanyao?)

509
36:11.980 --> 36:12.420
Chancellor,

510
36:12.900 --> 36:13.580
where are we going?

511
36:14.780 --> 36:15.980
South.

512
36:16.380 --> 36:17.260
Out of the city.

513
36:17.900 --> 36:18.220
(Got it.)

514
36:21.100 --> 36:26.140
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

515
36:29.980 --> 36:30.340
Come.

516
36:30.700 --> 36:31.260
Let's go home.

517
36:32.020 --> 36:32.460
Your Highness...

518
36:34.660 --> 36:35.260
I should be going.

519
36:36.580 --> 36:37.300
Where will you go?

520
36:40.220 --> 36:41.060
I've avenged my family,

521
36:41.540 --> 36:42.420
and thanks to Your Highness,

522
36:42.940 --> 36:43.660
I've escaped with my life.

523
36:44.620 --> 36:45.220
In this life,

524
36:45.780 --> 36:46.420
I have nothing more to ask for.

525
36:49.620 --> 36:50.500
I must return to Lingnan.

526
36:51.980 --> 36:52.820
You're leaving so soon?

527
36:58.780 --> 36:59.740
This cloak...

528
37:01.140 --> 37:01.700
You can keep it.

529
37:07.740 --> 37:08.460
It's dirty now.

530
37:09.300 --> 37:10.740
I can't return it like this.

531
37:11.980 --> 37:13.180
I'm afraid

532
37:14.220 --> 37:15.220
I can never repay you

533
37:16.020 --> 37:16.860
for saving my life.

534
37:24.340 --> 37:25.540
There's only one thing

535
37:27.060 --> 37:28.060
I can offer you in return.

536
37:52.820 --> 37:57.540
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

537
37:59.860 --> 38:00.340
Your Highness...

538
38:00.340 --> 38:03.460
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

539
38:03.460 --> 38:03.900
Take care.

540
38:07.260 --> 38:13.260
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

541
38:13.660 --> 38:13.940
Get out.

542
38:13.940 --> 38:19.100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

543
38:21.540 --> 38:26.780
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

544
38:26.780 --> 38:29.540
♪Through trails of mud♪

545
38:29.540 --> 38:29.980
(Yan Shang,)

546
38:31.500 --> 38:32.700
(is this really all)

547
38:34.260 --> 38:35.300
(you want from this life?)

548
38:35.300 --> 38:39.900
♪- Soar with the wind; burning bright - Plunge into hellfire as one♪

549
38:40.060 --> 38:43.500
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

550
38:43.740 --> 38:48.660
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

551
38:48.940 --> 38:53.620
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

552
38:53.780 --> 38:55.580
♪Not a single hour less♪

553
38:55.740 --> 38:59.480
♪However deep the snow♪

554
38:59.480 --> 39:03.340
♪I'll wait if you're there♪

555
39:03.420 --> 39:06.820
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

556
39:06.980 --> 39:10.460
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

557
39:10.660 --> 39:17.460
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

558
39:17.740 --> 39:19.220
♪- May time be free of fear - Boats rock♪

559
39:19.220 --> 39:22.260
♪- May time be free of pain - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

560
39:22.340 --> 39:24.820
♪You're the only one I need♪

561
39:24.860 --> 39:27.980
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain♪ (Mingde Gate)

562
39:27.980 --> 39:32.060
♪Nothing can break us♪

563
39:32.220 --> 39:34.960
♪Be my one and only in this world; be my one and only in this life♪

564
39:34.961 --> 39:35.500
(Mingde Gate)

565
39:35.580 --> 39:38.980
♪My last untouched innocence♪

566
39:47.860 --> 39:49.660
Young man, wait.

567
39:54.300 --> 39:54.860
Chancellor Liu.

568
39:57.500 --> 39:58.420
Don't forget,

569
39:59.380 --> 40:02.580
you still owe me a game of Go.

570
40:04.340 --> 40:05.780
Let's finish it before you go.

571
40:06.060 --> 40:06.740
What do you say?

572
40:08.940 --> 40:10.060
You waited here

573
40:10.780 --> 40:12.180
just to finish that game?

574
40:12.540 --> 40:13.060
That's right.

575
40:14.020 --> 40:15.980
Just for that game.

576
40:30.620 --> 40:32.260
Last time, you said

577
40:32.380 --> 40:35.500
you came to Sheng'an to right a wrong.

578
40:35.780 --> 40:37.740
Now that you're leaving,

579
40:38.180 --> 40:40.580
have you set things right?

580
40:44.580 --> 40:45.020
I have.

581
40:49.060 --> 40:52.580
Was killing Zhang Renjing really enough?

582
41:00.580 --> 41:01.540
To be frank,

583
41:02.540 --> 41:03.740
I'd seen you at the Imperial Academy

584
41:04.380 --> 41:05.300
long before we met.

585
41:05.820 --> 41:06.940
Out of curiosity,

586
41:07.300 --> 41:08.780
I looked into your background.

587
41:09.620 --> 41:10.940
I knew your father.

588
41:11.460 --> 41:12.620
He was good at poems

589
41:13.340 --> 41:14.700
and famous throughout the capital.

590
41:15.620 --> 41:17.020
I even met your mother

591
41:17.660 --> 41:20.180
at her parents' home before she married.

592
41:21.420 --> 41:23.380
What a remarkable woman,

593
41:23.860 --> 41:26.180
so free-spirited and above worldly concerns.

594
41:29.580 --> 41:31.220
Such fine youths.

595
41:35.340 --> 41:36.060
But I digress.

596
41:37.140 --> 41:38.340
At my age,

597
41:38.540 --> 41:40.220
I tend to ramble.

598
41:41.260 --> 41:42.780
I waited here today

599
41:43.340 --> 41:44.980
to ask you just one thing:

600
41:45.460 --> 41:46.740
is it truly enough?

601
41:53.180 --> 41:53.980
Zhang Renjing dared

602
41:54.940 --> 41:56.500
to kill innocents for military merit

603
41:57.180 --> 42:00.060
because he served in the Shence Army.

604
42:00.660 --> 42:03.020
The Shence Army dares to kill at will

605
42:03.500 --> 42:07.140
because Yu Cheng'an controls the court.

606
42:07.460 --> 42:08.540
Even His Majesty

607
42:09.300 --> 42:10.980
has to bow to him.

608
42:11.700 --> 42:14.780
The court keeps showering the Shence Army with rewards.

609
42:15.620 --> 42:17.860
Its officers can be promoted

610
42:18.220 --> 42:19.180
without even reporting.

611
42:20.060 --> 42:23.700
Even the censors dare not inspect it.

612
42:25.060 --> 42:27.100
Yu Cheng'an wields such power

613
42:27.580 --> 42:30.940
because His Majesty needs his Shence Army

614
42:31.220 --> 42:32.860
to keep the regional warlords in check.

615
42:33.620 --> 42:34.500
As for the warlords,

616
42:34.980 --> 42:38.660
they've amassed troops and grown restless.

617
42:38.900 --> 42:39.460
They've even demanded

618
42:40.260 --> 42:42.540
princesses into humiliating marriages

619
42:42.780 --> 42:46.300
just to buy the court a moment's peace.

620
42:48.020 --> 42:49.380
They'll rebel again

621
42:49.780 --> 42:54.500
at the slightest opportunity.

622
43:01.740 --> 43:03.220
Lord Yu controls the court,

623
43:04.540 --> 43:06.260
the warlords run rampant,

624
43:07.260 --> 43:08.780
and the officials turn a blind eye.

625
43:10.180 --> 43:11.380
You're right, Chancellor.

626
43:12.780 --> 43:14.260
Zhang Renjing wasn't the only one

627
43:15.420 --> 43:16.380
who made my family suffer.

628
43:17.300 --> 43:20.100
Nor was he the only one who slaughtered

629
43:21.260 --> 43:22.860
countless innocents.

630
43:31.260 --> 43:31.780
What a shame,

631
43:33.060 --> 43:34.380
I'm just a commoner.

632
43:36.420 --> 43:37.380
There's nothing I can do.

633
43:41.700 --> 43:46.300
(Next Episode Preview)

634
43:46.460 --> 43:47.180
Thank you, Your Highness.

635
43:47.860 --> 43:49.660
I'll probably need to borrow from you a lot.

636
43:50.260 --> 43:52.500
Looking you over,

637
43:53.620 --> 43:54.900
that mouth is your only real asset.

638
43:55.380 --> 43:55.860
Make sure

639
43:56.420 --> 43:57.380
you put it to good use.

640
43:59.180 --> 44:01.320
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world♪

641
44:03.520 --> 44:06.813
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

642
44:09.498 --> 44:14.414
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

643
44:16.608 --> 44:22.453
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

644
44:22.953 --> 44:28.179
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

645
44:30.948 --> 44:35.739
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

646
44:36.575 --> 44:42.654
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

647
44:44.455 --> 44:47.605
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

648
44:47.605 --> 44:49.253
♪Burning bright as a song♪

649
44:49.305 --> 44:53.029
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

650
44:53.407 --> 44:58.073
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

651
44:58.692 --> 45:02.733
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

652
45:03.224 --> 45:05.339
♪Not a single hour less♪

653
45:05.379 --> 45:12.325
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

654
45:13.088 --> 45:16.541
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

655
45:16.721 --> 45:19.866
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

656
45:20.305 --> 45:26.942
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

657
45:27.339 --> 45:29.377
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

658
45:29.377 --> 45:31.853
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

659
45:31.891 --> 45:34.360
♪You're the only one I need♪

660
45:34.564 --> 45:41.451
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

661
45:41.763 --> 45:45.034
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

662
45:45.339 --> 45:48.512
♪My last untouched innocence♪

663
45:48.836 --> 45:52.262
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

664
45:52.495 --> 45:55.720
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

665
45:56.051 --> 46:02.847
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

666
46:03.216 --> 46:05.278
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

667
46:05.279 --> 46:07.782
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

